        "description": "Characteristic craniofacial dysmorphic features including hypertelorism and broad nasal bridge",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Genetic confirmation of 21q22.11q22.12 microdeletion plus presence of developmental delay or intellectual disability",
    "notes": "Diagnosis relies primarily on genetic testing; clinical features support but are variable."
